{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/703896ce87e9acb514c669067278cddc.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tulip Season is a cozy farming sim all about tulips. Plant, water, and nurture flowers as daily surprises hit the field. Sell bouquets, unlock new varieties, and get to know your customers. Maximize your field beauty to earn the king\u2019s praise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/baaca07631748e115a73c06037df2681.poster.avif?t=1760453668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/baaca07631748e115a73c06037df2681.webm?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/baaca07631748e115a73c06037df2681.mp4?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure: progress at your own speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy going mechanics: you are here to relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One crop, many varieties: 12 tulip types in rich colors and combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on a single field: everything you need will be deliveret to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters and environment inspired by Dutch art and folklore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/436e15d64714a47f0ec64029d3b32bf3.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant bulbs and care for them to raise the value of your flowers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings small events in your field that need your attention or bring bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/c55be90e652ac48bc506aa748f019fd2.poster.avif?t=1760453668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/c55be90e652ac48bc506aa748f019fd2.webm?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/c55be90e652ac48bc506aa748f019fd2.mp4?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/f8a9b7d42b50a4a4e97833f678191ea5.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trader will recognize you as a serious buyer once you\u2019ve spent enough at his shop, unlocking advanced tulip varieties just for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tulip type starts with a base color, but through breeding you can discover new shades and even rare double-colored blooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/90c0b7caa7a03042416676cb87b60116.poster.avif?t=1760453668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/90c0b7caa7a03042416676cb87b60116.webm?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/90c0b7caa7a03042416676cb87b60116.mp4?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/cc65495c6c523d41c40586e457286f7c.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with visitors passing by your farm and learn more about their stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may need a favour from you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/5d13a4e9bdee577c7deb80f8045fdfaf.avif?t=1760453668\" data-has-big width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/ea84dbd0d98a97161eb69853ae8ff9b4.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in useful upgrades like a windmill pump to water your field at once, or a shed with more storage space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up to purchase neighboring land and expand your tulip empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add beautiful decorations to your farm and surroundings to delight your customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/81570798e7dfeda075651646778c5726.poster.avif?t=1760453668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/81570798e7dfeda075651646778c5726.webm?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/81570798e7dfeda075651646778c5726.mp4?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/2d2cef34038672be36daba19627d6761.avif?t=1760453668\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design stunning fields with flowers, patterns, and decorations to earn royal recognition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/1e8c7d3fddf97392acde6be278428ed4.poster.avif?t=1760453668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/1e8c7d3fddf97392acde6be278428ed4.webm?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/1e8c7d3fddf97392acde6be278428ed4.mp4?t=1760453668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1760453668","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1760453668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/f5c9b842e724c275231ad01f75af625bc714d686/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760453668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co